---
/** Placeholder for future pattern tagging — no functionality yet. */
---

<section
  id="my-tags"
  class="dashboard-card dashboard-card--tags"
  aria-labelledby="my-tags-heading"
>
  <h2 id="my-tags-heading" class="dashboard-card__title">My Tags</h2>
  <p class="dashboard-card__subtitle dashboard-card__subtitle--tags">
    A personal organizing layer for your knitting — coming soon.
  </p>

  <div class="dashboard-tags-preview">
    <p class="dashboard-tags-preview__lead">
      Tags will let you group saved patterns and projects the way you actually knit:
      what to make next, gifts in progress, favorite fits, yarn plans, and seasonal ideas.
    </p>
    <ul class="dashboard-tags-preview__examples" aria-label="Example tags coming later">
      <li>Knit next</li>
      <li>Unfinished</li>
      <li>Gifts</li>
      <li>Favorite fit</li>
      <li>Yarn categories</li>
      <li>Seasonal tags</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="dashboard-tags-preview__note">
      We are building this as a calm way to sort your workspace — not another to-do list.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dashboard-card--tags {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fafbf9 0%, #fff 100%);
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: #d1d5db;
  }

  .dashboard-card__subtitle--tags {
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .dashboard-tags-preview__lead {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    max-width: 38rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #4b5563;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .dashboard-tags-preview__examples {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .dashboard-tags-preview__examples li {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .dashboard-tags-preview__note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
